</head><body class="__variable_geist_0tvmz3h __variable_geist_mono_1diim1n antialiased"><main><header class="site-header"><a class="brand-link" href="#top"><span class="brand-lockup" aria-label="Churvox"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>CHURVOX</span></span></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#product">Product</a><a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="#trades">For trades</a><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a></nav><div class="header-actions"><a class="login-link" href="/login">Log in</a><a class="button button-dark button-small" href="/signup">Start free <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></header><section class="hero" id="top"><div class="hero-grain"></div><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span>FOR PEOPLE WHO DO THE REAL WORK</p><h1>Run the job.<br/><em>Not the admin.</em></h1><p class="hero-lede">Churvox keeps jobs, clients, workers, quotes and invoices moving quietly in the background. You stay in control and approve what matters.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-orange" href="/signup">Start your 14-day free trial <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#how-it-works">See how Churvox works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><p class="trial-note">No card required · Cancel anytime</p></div><div class="hero-product" aria-label="Churvox owner workspace"><div class="product-glow"></div><div class="app-shell"><div class="app-rail"><div class="rail-logo"><span class="brand-lockup" aria-label="Churvox"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>CHURVOX</span></span></div><div class="rail-menu"><span class="active">Today</span><span>Command</span><span>Jobs</span><span>Clients</span><span>Workers</span><span>Quotes</span><span>Invoices</span></div><div class="rail-foot"><span>HG</span><small>Harbour Grounds</small></div></div><div class="app-main"><div class="app-topbar"><div><small>THURSDAY, 23 JULY</small><strong>Morning. Your workday is ready.</strong></div><div class="topbar-actions"><span class="status-dot">Everything ready</span><button aria-label="Add a new job">+ Add job</button></div></div><div class="day-brief"><div><p class="brief-label">YOUR DAY, SORTED</p><h2>Here&#x27;s what needs you.</h2></div><div class="weather"><b>14°</b><span>Fine all day<br/>Wellington</span></div></div><div class="workspace-grid"><section class="today-run"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="live-pulse"></span>TODAY&#x27;S RUN</div><small>6 jobs · 2 workers</small></div><article class="job-row done"><time>8:00</time><span class="job-line"></span><div><strong>Smith hedge trim</strong><small>12 Oak Street · Mike</small></div><b>DONE</b></article><article class="job-row current"><time>10:30</time><span class="job-line"></span><div><strong>Riverside lawns</strong><small>88 River Road · James</small></div><b>ON SITE</b></article><article class="job-row"><time>1:00</time><span class="job-line"></span><div><strong>Parkes garden tidy</strong><small>4 Pine Avenue · Mike</small></div><b>READY</b></article><article class="job-row"><time>3:30</time><span class="job-line"></span><div><strong>Westside section</strong><small>21 Bell Street · Unassigned</small></div><b class="warn">CHECK</b></article></section><section class="approval-desk"><div class="section-title"><div>NEEDS YOUR OK</div><strong>3</strong></div><article><span class="approval-icon">$</span><div><small>INVOICE DRAFT</small><strong>Smith hedge trim</strong><p>Ready to send · $184.00</p></div><button aria-label="Review invoice">Review</button></article><article><span class="approval-icon">↻</span><div><small>JOB CHANGE</small><strong>Riverside lawns</strong><p>Worker requested +30 min</p></div><button aria-label="Review job change">Review</button></article><article><span class="approval-icon">Q</span><div><small>QUOTE DRAFT</small><strong>Coastal property</strong><p>Prepared from site notes</p></div><button aria-label="Review quote">Review</button></article></section></div></div></div></div></section><section class="trust-strip" aria-label="Churvox product benefits"><p>ONE QUIET WORKSPACE FOR YOUR WHOLE WORKDAY</p><div><span>Jobs</span><i></i><span>Clients</span><i></i><span>Workers</span><i></i><span>Quotes</span><i></i><span>Invoices</span></div></section><section class="product-intro" id="product"><p class="eyebrow dark"><span></span>THE CHURVOX DIFFERENCE</p><h2>The office in the background.<br/><em>You in front.</em></h2><p>Churvox prepares the next step, brings exceptions to your attention and keeps the everyday work organised. Nothing important happens without your approval.</p></section><section class="how-grid" id="how-it-works"><article><b>01</b><h3>Work comes in</h3><p>Add a job once. Keep the client, site notes, timing and worker in one clear place.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Churvox prepares</h3><p>Your day, follow-ups, draft quotes and draft invoices are organised in the background.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>You approve</h3><p>Check the small approval queue. Edit anything you want, then give it your OK.</p></article></section><section class="closing-cta" id="trades"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span>LESS ADMIN. MORE REAL WORK.</p><h2>Ready to get your workday back?</h2></div><a class="button button-light" href="/signup">Start free for 14 days <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section><footer><span class="brand-lockup" aria-label="Churvox"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>CHURVOX</span></span><p>Job management that works like an office in the background.</p><span>© 2026 Churvox</span></footer></main><script id="_R_">import("/assets/index-BZXWNUtr.js")</script><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||a.contentWindow.document;if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a201ce94bb53ace1',t:'MTc4NDg4NDM4Ng=='};var a=document.create